ies.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [51.99609375, 377.82421875, 524.3789672851562, 399.9975891113281], "text": "NOTE 2: These guidelines may not apply in all situations. Electromagnetic propagation is affected by absorption and reflection from structures, objects and people.", "type": "Text"}], "doc_id": "91521110100M_4K_UHD_Display_User_Manual_V1.1.pdf", "page_index": 22, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/91521110100M_4K_UHD_Display_User_Manual_V1.1.pdf", "source": "marker"}